  "prefLabel": "Mec 102.06 Direct supervision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 102.06 “Direct supervision” means a supervisor is physically present and immediately available for direction and supervision and has direct contact with the supervisee while the individual is in the process of learning and applying their skills. The term does not include supervision by telecommunication.\n\nSource. #13483, eff 1-9-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 100); #14408, eff 10-17-25",
